    Q("What finally worked?", "a reward for letting go", ["a louder voice", "throwing the ball further away", "a ball that smells of cheese"], "'Every time he dropped the ball, he got a tiny piece of cheese.'", ["Shouting isn't in the blog.", "Distance isn't in the blog.", "The cheese was a treat, not on the ball."]),
