    Q("What was Ravi's first year of chess like?", "he didn't win at all", ["he won every game", "he played only on Sundays", "he got bored"], "'I lost every game for a year!'", ["He lost every game.", "Sundays are football day.", "Boredom isn't in the interview."]),
